  {
   "item_id": 262321,
   "item_text": "Click for solution",
   "item_forum_id": 0,
   "item_type": "post_hidden",
   "in_feed": null,
   "is_watched": null,
   "item_score": "990",
   "id": "27415",
   "item_level": "990",
   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 262321,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 37429,
    "poster_id": 5412,
    "post_rendered": "let's assume that <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579b0603d25cce64f91b0ac93bee2cfd0b254452.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq y \\geq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" >,</span> thus <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdc7d7401f93afefd83bdcc5b13cbfbc202ba784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^3 \\geq x^3+y^3+z^3=nx^2y^2z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"232\" height=\"18\" >,</span> so<br>\n<span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6fb98d5ca337d4e3628ae16e842462ec815870.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\geq \\frac{ny^2z^2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"81\" height=\"39\" >.</span> Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f922a85efd3d6a52d98652c74d9c2532fbcb649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+y^3+z^3=nx^2y^2z^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" > thus <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/0/06057d7a476a3f8c57df3064bcd9c3e6118b9d1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2|y^3+z^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" >,</span> so<br>\n<span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b68053c5b2f55d6cf204707fd1503682d52f292f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y^3 \\geq y^3+z^3 \\geq x^2 \\geq \\frac{n^2y^4z^4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"227\" height=\"39\" >.</span><br>\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf27b25b0af3fcd6657702aeb9fe135ba6623994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/4/d6446de137a1a79e8a49a31fb8ffb1dc125d61c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\leq \\frac{18}{16n^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" > so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/6672e757cc724c64f91e645b251145147bbf555a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\geq z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > - contradiction.<br>\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd3d68e77a39e1ea97e7009f70e12622fa76835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" > then <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57be6e6adce527339b41c35240584a351fd9552b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^3+1 \\geq \\frac{n^2y^4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"110\" height=\"39\" >,</span> so <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab1bc40a0f5e67c8169430938e5fb965121ded68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+\\frac{9}{y^3} \\geq n^2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"104\" height=\"41\" >.</span><br>\n-If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3fff698145bc1b9d2e7d3ecec37912d2aad7409.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+2=nx^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" > so the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35905c256678ac871caa3014ed70592a4999e03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z,n)=(1,1,1,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add51d316eb5d2222d6c560e88c30fc1297b99b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2|2=&gt;x=1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"126\" height=\"19\" > so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > satisfies.<br>\n-If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b9845c168b2536a28057556dfc680eef7f658833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3fc55872475eb1097d63d79aab7cabb980ca84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\geq n^2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" > so<br>\na) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > then for instance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d3b65e4a2003e5593f32b2ee8cd97432fc67d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z,n)=(3,2,1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" > is a solution so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > also satisfies<br>\nb) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > then there are no solutions-easy to check.<br>\nc) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/3/6c3b4834614e5e7e189cb7d621cfb4fb0bd36dd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" > that gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad5179c31522674b3230a7a5b6c0ede1357e41b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,1,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" > what we had before.<br>\n(q.e.d.)<br>\nAnswer : <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810881a82b725ee1cb3df1cb4fd2e279623bf0d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" >",
    "post_canonical": "let's assume that $x \\geq y \\geq z$, thus $3x^3 \\geq x^3+y^3+z^3=nx^2y^2z^2$, so\r\n$x \\geq \\frac{ny^2z^2}{3}$. Because $x^3+y^3+z^3=nx^2y^2z^2$ thus $x^2|y^3+z^3$, so\r\n$2y^3 \\geq y^3+z^3 \\geq x^2 \\geq \\frac{n^2y^4z^4}{9}$.\r\nIf $z>1$ then $y \\leq \\frac{18}{16n^2}$ so $y=1$ but $y \\geq z$ - contradiction. \r\nIf $z=1$ then $y^3+1 \\geq \\frac{n^2y^4}{9}$, so $9+\\frac{9}{y^3} \\geq n^2y$.\r\n-If $y=1$ then $x^3+2=nx^2$ so the only solution is $(x,y,z,n)=(1,1,1,3)$ $(x^2|2=>x=1)$ so $n=3$ satisfies.\r\n-If $y>1$ then $10 \\geq n^2y$ so\r\na) $n=1$ then for instance $(x,y,z,n)=(3,2,1,1)$ is a solution so $n=1$ also satisfies\r\nb) $n=2$ then $y=2$ or $y=1$ then there are no solutions-easy to check.\r\nc) $n=3$ and $y=1$ that gives $(1,1,1,3)$ what we had before.\r\n(q.e.d.)\r\nAnswer : $n=1,3$",
